{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HyperBlade 2050</strong> is a futuristic text-based sports management simulation set on a dystopian Earth. Experience the excitement of professional sports management, whilst being drawn into the rich lore of society in an alternative future of the 2050s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo version</strong> allows you to play through your first season with any HyperBlade team, you can save your progress and continue your career in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/9d59467fd145023252861ab7a10108a5.avif?t=1759412776\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the visionary futuristic sport of HyperBlade, a compelling combination of ice hockey, handball, and roller derby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a head coach, managing your roster of players game-to-game and through their careers, experiencing the emotions, passion, and excitement of sports management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/d4c7f1fa6c187db47b20b1976ad2d95b.avif?t=1759412776\" width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique dystopian game world is set on a future Earth in the year 2050. Uncover the story of a world dealing with the rapid pace of globalisation, climate change and technological change, and how those challenges have impacted on sport and society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team &amp; tactics selection, trading with other teams, training your players and contract negotiation are just some of the skills you will need to master in the world of HyperBlade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/5328e19dc44aaf1c19360d751036f7f0.avif?t=1759412776\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HyperBlade 2050 is inspired by original Championship Manager games from the 90s and the 1975 movie Rollerball with James Caan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048310?t=1759412776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048310?t=1759412776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/21d654f0a7859898ba6baf6016a98e5b016a2913/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759412776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/21d654f0a7859898ba6baf6016a98e5b016a2913/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759412776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains written descriptions of injury and death caused to athletes participating in a violent future sport, along with occasional non-detailed references to mature themes. Content is suitable for ages 14 and up."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HyperBlade 2050</strong> is a futuristic text-based sports management simulation set on a dystopian Earth. Experience the excitement of professional sports management, whilst being drawn into the rich lore of society in an alternative future of the 2050s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo version</strong> allows you to play through your first season with any HyperBlade team, you can save your progress and continue your career in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/9d59467fd145023252861ab7a10108a5.avif?t=1759412776\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the visionary futuristic sport of HyperBlade, a compelling combination of ice hockey, handball, and roller derby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a head coach, managing your roster of players game-to-game and through their careers, experiencing the emotions, passion, and excitement of sports management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/d4c7f1fa6c187db47b20b1976ad2d95b.avif?t=1759412776\" width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique dystopian game world is set on a future Earth in the year 2050. Uncover the story of a world dealing with the rapid pace of globalisation, climate change and technological change, and how those challenges have impacted on sport and society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team &amp; tactics selection, trading with other teams, training your players and contract negotiation are just some of the skills you will need to master in the world of HyperBlade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/extras/5328e19dc44aaf1c19360d751036f7f0.avif?t=1759412776\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HyperBlade 2050 is inspired by original Championship Manager games from the 90s and the 1975 movie Rollerball with James Caan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dejima Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3106110","name":"HyperBlade 2050 - Dystopian Sports Manager"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048310/6cf1842e5d8eeaa93ae54ef96bea435f40cc8598/header.jpg?t=1759412776","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048310/1790246852/66b8f3603ba86d2b4ed1d8f7abf0fc8b22fdacc5/1758725773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759412774","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048310/1790246852/66b8f3603ba86d2b4ed1d8f7abf0fc8b22fdacc5/1758725773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759412774","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048310/1790246852/66b8f3603ba86d2b4ed1d8f7abf0fc8b22fdacc5/1758725773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759412774","id":257205507,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205507/movie480.mp4?t=1759412774","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205507/movie_max.mp4?t=1759412774"},"name":"HyperBlade 2050 launch trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205507/51886b8074474468df533c40c182c8509bca4dff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759412774","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205507/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759412774","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205507/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759412774"}}],"name":"HyperBlade 2050 