t being drawn into the rich lore of society in an alternative future of the 2050s. This demo lets you play through your first season.","steam_appid":4048310,"support_info":{"email":"info@dejimastudios.com","url":"https://www.dejimastudios.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://www.dejimastudios.com/"}